    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "557058:e25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Chris Wilper",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ae25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Discussed during the Jan 18th committer meeting:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "We generally agreed that the commandline utils should have a copy of the needed libs separate from those deployed in the webapp container....it's weird/problematic otherwise.  So, this issue is being opened with that solution in mind.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Regarding different lib locations for different containers for the purpose of the webapp only (some go into tomcat/common/lib, some go in tomcat/webapps/fedora/WEB-INF/lib), there is a separate outstanding issue whose solution we think would address that: ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-504"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "https://jira.duraspace.org/browse/FCREPO-504",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "During the discussion, Asger also pointed out that it would be good to have an easy way to deploy custom modules/code without necessarily opening the war file, inserting your libs, and re-packaging, then re-deploying it.  He'll submit a separate issue for that.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
